            Row 0 (numbers):  X = +0.038   14 keys
            Row 1 (QWERTY):   X = +0.019   14 keys
            Row 2 (home):     X =  0.000   13 keys
            Row 3 (bottom):   X = −0.019   12 keys
            Row 4 (space):    X = −0.038    7 keys (space bar wide)

          Columns along Y (col 0 at Y = −0.1235, step +0.019):
            Col i:  Y = −0.1235 + i * 0.019

          12 control keys are colour-coded; all others are dark gray.
          Control-key mapping (real key → function):
            Q→none_0  W→x_pos  E→none_9
            A→y_pos   S→x_neg  D→y_neg
            U→yaw_pos J→yaw_neg
            O→open_gripper  P→close_gripper
